      ***------------------------------------------------------------***

      ***------------------------------------------------------------***
      *                       DESCRIPTION                              *
      *                       ===========                              *
      *   INPUT:  chercheuse                                           *
      ***------------------------------------------------------------***

       Identification division. 
      *========================*
       program-id.  ARCHIINSERT.

       Environment division.
      *====================*

       Configuration section.   
      *----------------------*  
       source-computer.  unisys-2200.   
       object-computer.  unisys-2200 MEMORY 3 MODULES.  
       special-names.   
           printer       printer
           decimal-point comma. 
    
       Input-output section.
      *---------------------*   
       file-control.
           select chercheuse assign to disc    [filein,1,1,1].  
       i-o-control. 

       Data division.   
      *==============*  

       File section.
      *-------------*   
      * Fichier chercheuse  
       FD  chercheuse.  
       01  no-rch              pic 9([filein,1,1,2]).   
    
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION. 
      *------------------------*
      *--------------- VARIABLES DE TRAVAIL ----------  
        01 lecturef                    pic 9 value 0.   
           88 fin-lecture              value 1. 
        01 ws-vl-pnt-rep.   
           3 ws-vl-cpt-lu-cpr         pic 9(10).
           3 ws-vl-cpt-ins-cpr        pic 9(10).
           3     pic x(40). 
      *----------------------------------------------   
      *---------------- FLAGS ------------------------  
        77 fl-pre                     pic 9.
        77 fl-cpr                     pic 9.
        77 fl-ins-cpr                 pic 9.
        77 fl-rch-vide                pic 9.
      *-----------------------------------------------  
      *------------- DATE ET HEURE -------------------  
        01 ws-date                     pic 9(8).
        01 ws-dt-i redefines ws-date.   
           3 ws-aa-i                   pic 9(4).
           3 ws-mm-i                   pic 99.  
           3 ws-jj-i                   pic 99.  
        01 ws-dt-fr.
           3 ws-jj-fr                  pic 99.  
           3    pic x value "/".
           3 ws-mm-fr                  pic 99.  
           3    pic x value "/".
           3 ws-aa-fr                  pic 9(4).
        01 ws-hre-tot.  
           3 ws-hre                   pic 9(6). 
           3     pic 99.
      *-----------------------------------------------  
      *-------------- COMPTEURS ----------------------  
        77 cpt-commit                  PIC 999. 
        77 cpt-lu                      PIC 9(10).   
        77 cpt-ins                     pic 9(10).   
        77 cpt-luf                     PIC z(9)9.   
        77 cpt-insf                    pic z(9)9.   
      *-------------------------------------------------------- 

      *.RDMS-ESQL.==============================================================
      *  VARIABLES DE CONTROLE RDMS ET ESQL 
      *-------------------------------------------------------------------------

       01 SQLSTATE                PIC X(05) USAGE DISPLAY.  
           COPY WS-ESQL-VAR  OF COMMONS.

           COPY ESQL-INVOKE OF COMMONS  
                REPLACING ==NM-TAB== BY ==CHK_PNT_RST==.

           COPY ESQL-INVOKE OF COMMONS  
                REPLACING "NM-TAB" BY "[table,1,1,1]".  
    
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.  
      *==================*  
        000-main.   
           open input chercheuse
           perform 010-init-db thru 010-exit
           perform 020-init-var thru 020-exit   
           perform 030-pre-trait thru 030-exit  
           perform 040-lec-fic thru 040-exit
           perform 050-rapport thru 050-exit
           perform 060-fin-db thru 060-exit 
           close chercheuse 
           stop run 
           .
      *--------- INITIALISATION DE LA DB -----------------  
        010-init-db.
           MOVE  "0"                   TO  WS-ESQL-FL-THREAD
           EXEC SQL 
                    BEGIN THREAD FOR UDSSRC UPDATE (QUICKLOOKS) 
           END-EXEC 
           IF  SQLCODE NOT = 0  
               PERFORM  999-ESQL-ERR
               PERFORM  999-ESQL-ABORT  
           END-IF   
           MOVE  "1"                   TO  WS-ESQL-FL-THREAD
           COPY  ESQL-USE              OF  COMMONS. 
           COPY  ESQL-USE-DYN          OF  COMMONS. 
           IF  SQLCODE NOT = 0  
               PERFORM  999-ESQL-ERR
               PERFORM  999-ESQL-ABORT  
           END-IF   
           .
        010-exit.   
           exit.
      *-------- INIT DES VARIABLES -------------
        020-init-var.   
           move zeroes to fl-pre
                          fl-cpr
                          fl-ins-cpr
                          fl-rch-vide   
                          ws-date   
                          ws-hre
                          ws-vl-pnt-rep 
                          cpt-commit
                          cpt-lu
                          cpt-ins   
                          cpt-luf   
                          cpt-insf  
           .
        020-exit.   
           exit.
      *----- PREMIERE LECTURE DU FICHIER  --------- 
        030-pre-trait.  
           read chercheuse  
             at end 
               move 1 to lecturef fl-rch-vide   
             not at end 
               move 1 to fl-pre 
               accept ws-hre-tot from time  
               perform 100-lec-cpr thru 100-exit
           end-read 
           accept ws-date from date yyyymmdd
           move ws-aa-i to ws-aa-fr 
           move ws-mm-i to ws-mm-fr 
           move ws-jj-i to ws-jj-fr 
           .
        030-exit.   
           exit.
      *---------- LECTURE DU FICHIER ---------  
        040-lec-fic.
           perform until fin-lecture
             add 1 to cpt-lu
             if fl-cpr = 1  
               add 1 to ws-vl-cpt-lu-cpr
               perform until cpt-lu = ws-vl-cpt-lu-cpr  
                 read chercheuse
                   at end   
                     move 1 to lecturef 
                     move cpt-lu to ws-vl-cpt-lu-cpr
                   not at end   
                     add 1 to cpt-lu
                 end-read   
               end-perform  
             end-if 
             perform 101-ins-rch thru 101-exit  
             read chercheuse
               at end   
                 move 1 to lecturef 
             end-read   
           end-perform  
           if fl-rch-vide = 0   
             perform 102-del-cpr thru 102-exit  
           end-if   
           .
        040-exit.   
           exit.
      *--------------- RAPPORT  --------
        050-rapport.
           move cpt-lu to cpt-luf   
           move cpt-ins to cpt-insf 
           display "ARCHIINSERT      Rapport       " ws-dt-fr   
             upon printer   
           display "tot lu = " cpt-luf upon printer 
           display "tot ins = " cpt-insf upon printer   
           .
        050-exit.   
           exit.
      *--------------- FIN CONNECTION DB ------------   
        060-fin-db. 
           IF  WS-ESQL-FL-THREAD = "1"  
             EXEC SQL  END THREAD  END-EXEC 
             MOVE 0 TO WS-ESQL-FL-THREAD
           end-if   
           .
        060-exit.   
           exit.
      *------- LECTURE DU PARAMETRE DE CHK_PNT_RST -------  
        100-lec-cpr.
           exec sql 
             select vl_pnt_rep  
             into   :ws-vl-pnt-rep  
             from   chk_pnt_rst 
             where  mr_prg_maj   =  'ARCHII'
           end-exec 
           evaluate sqlcode 
             when 0 
               move 1 to fl-cpr 
               move 0 to fl-ins-cpr 
               move ws-vl-cpt-ins-cpr to cpt-ins
             when 100   
               move 1 to ws-vl-cpt-lu-cpr   
                         fl-ins-cpr 
               move 0 to fl-cpr 
             when other 
               move "100-lec-cpr" to ws-esql-trace  
               perform 999-esql-err 
               perform 999-esql-abort   
           end-evaluate 
           .
        100-exit.   
      *----------- INSERT DANS LA TABLE CHERCHEUSE ------   
        101-ins-rch.
           EXEC SQL 
                INSERT INTO [table,1,1,1]   
                 COLUMNS
                   ([table,1,1,2]       =     :no-rch)  
           END-EXEC.
           evaluate sqlcode 
             when 0 
               add 1 to cpt-ins 
               add 1 to cpt-commit  
               if cpt-commit > 500  
                 perform 500-commit thru 500-exit   
               end-if   
      *Continue si la cl{ existe!   
             when -6003 
               continue 
             when other 
               display "no chercheuse: " no-rch upon printer
               MOVE "101-ins-rch" TO WS-ESQL-TRACE  
               PERFORM 999-ESQL-ERR 
               PERFORM 999-ESQL-ABORT   
           end-evaluate 
           .
        101-exit.   
           exit.
      *----------- DELETE DU PARAMETRE CPR -------  
        102-del-cpr.
           exec sql 
             delete Chk_Pnt_Rst 
             where mr_prg_maj = 'ARCHII'
           end-exec 
           if sqlcode not = 0   
              move "102-del-cpr" to ws-esql-trace   
              perform 999-esql-err  
              perform 999-esql-abort
           end-if   
           .
        102-exit.   
           exit.
      *------------ EFFETUE UN COMMIT DANS LA DB ------------   
        500-commit. 
           perform 600-maj-cpr thru 600-exit
           EXEC SQL COMMIT WORK END-EXEC.   
           IF SQLCODE NOT = 0   
              MOVE "500-commit" TO WS-ESQL-TRACE
              PERFORM 999-ESQL-ERR  
              PERFORM 999-ESQL-ABORT
           END-IF   
           move 0 to cpt-commit 
           .
        500-exit.   
           exit.
      *------------ MAJ DE CHK_PNT_RST -----------  
        600-maj-cpr.
           move cpt-lu to ws-vl-cpt-lu-cpr  
           move cpt-ins to ws-vl-cpt-ins-cpr
           if fl-ins-cpr = 1
             exec sql   
               insert into chk_pnt_rst  
                 columns (mr_prg_maj  =  'ARCHII',  
                          vl_pnt_rep  =  :ws-vl-pnt-rep,
                          mr_dat_maj  =  :ws-date,  
                          mr_hre_maj  =  :ws-hre)   
             end-exec   
             evaluate sqlcode   
               when 0   
                 move 0 to fl-ins-cpr   
               when 100 
                 continue   
               when other   
               move "600-maj-cpr: insert" to ws-esql-trace  
               perform 999-esql-err 
               perform 999-esql-abort   
             end-evaluate   
           else 
             exec sql   
               update chk_pnt_rst   
                 columns (vl_pnt_rep  =  :ws-vl-pnt-rep)
                 where    mr_prg_maj  =  'ARCHII'   
             end-exec   
             if sqlcode not = 0 
                 move "600-maj-cpr: update" to ws-esql-trace
                 perform 999-esql-err   
                 perform 999-esql-abort 
             end-if 
           end-if   
           .
        600-exit.   
           exit.

      * GESTION DES ERREURS RDMS *  
      ****************************  
           COPY  999-ESQL-ERR          OF  COMMONS. 

       999-ESQL-ABORT.  
      *===============* 
           CALL "EREABT$".  
           STOP RUN.
